<section class="obodesk-section obodesk-core">
  <div class="obodesk-section__header">
    <p class="obodesk-eyebrow">Core System</p>
    <h2>The Foundation of a Better Setup</h2>
    <p>
      A focused desk starts with the essentials: surface control, elevated screens, organized tools, and clean cable
      paths.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="obodesk-grid obodesk-grid--four">
    <article class="obodesk-card">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Surface</h3>
      <p>Desk mats and working zones that make every movement feel intentional.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="obodesk-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Display</h3>
      <p>Monitor height, laptop elevation, and screen position built around long sessions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="obodesk-card">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Organization</h3>
      <p>Trays, docks, and holders that keep the active workspace clear.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="obodesk-card">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Cable Flow</h3>
      <p>Simple routing that keeps power, charging, and accessories under control.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

